"The blade that killed Syncarius is an adamantium dagger the Aleph grid once treasured."
"It weaves wizardry between the material and aetheric planes and seems indestructible."
"In this season the dagger lies in Sussu's vault in Esebus, not in Aleph hands."
"Years later Nathan Lark takes it from the vault; it is the one item he can hold unbroken."
"Sarya reveres the dagger, and it survives a Blightmind unblemished."
"At the Conclave the dagger crumbles after Nathan uses it."
